{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swim. Grow. Try again.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Siegeturtle</strong> is a cozy idle roguelite auto-battler about a turtle making its way home through hostile seas. Your turtle moves automatically while companions support you along the journey. Upgrade attributes, skills, and equipment to push a little further with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/dde818f49810f21dd7ac2c758b76d0f9.poster.avif?t=1768834691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/dde818f49810f21dd7ac2c758b76d0f9.webm?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/dde818f49810f21dd7ac2c758b76d0f9.mp4?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A jetpack? A cannon? Why not both! Blast through diverse biomes with quirky upgrades and unexpected power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/9cbf853f6c5aa62983e5c72ae4c316e6.poster.avif?t=1768834691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/9cbf853f6c5aa62983e5c72ae4c316e6.webm?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/9cbf853f6c5aa62983e5c72ae4c316e6.mp4?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Companions!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit dolphins, unicorns, seals and more! Each grants a unique ability to your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/2bf6750cd0b1ae17d4794f48195db985.poster.avif?t=1768834691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/2bf6750cd0b1ae17d4794f48195db985.webm?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/2bf6750cd0b1ae17d4794f48195db985.mp4?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish for Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your turtle out to fish between battles. Sell your catch for gold, or keep them for passive stat bonuses. Upgrade your <i>imaginary fishing rod</i> to reel in even rarer finds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/dab3c52bec7f2fca28b47088f10d556d.poster.avif?t=1768834691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/dab3c52bec7f2fca28b47088f10d556d.webm?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/dab3c52bec7f2fca28b47088f10d556d.mp4?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up your favorite attributes!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strength, Agility, Intelligence, or Vitality. Which will you choose?\u00a0</strong>Each attribute shapes your turtle in unique ways, letting you grow stronger with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your playstyle.\u00a0</strong>Spend skill points to upgrade your turtle and companions, unlocking abilities that match how you like to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt for legendary loot.\u00a0</strong>Summon powerful bosses to earn new gear and discover synergies that boost gold gain, regeneration, drop rates, critical hits, and more. Break down unwanted equipment into upgrade materials to raise your summoning level and increase your chances of scoring rare items.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend and Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the time is right, reset your journey in a surge of new power. Each ascension grants permanent upgrades to make your turtle faster and stronger than before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.poster.avif?t=1768834691\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.webm?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.mp4?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Polished Shell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3959050/20eb3b96526264bee045e10df9bd3b85a214e879.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the Shell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3959050/626f768c5dc9b700ea4d432cae1ace74e0386ef3.jpg"},{"name":"Strong as Shell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3959050/c0ea687a3eccde3210a5455484519a02bcae86c2.jpg"},{"name":"Enhancer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3959050/f43d7920c227e23939c7ca7b71b6dc3de776c378.jpg"},{"name":"Blacksmith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3959050/775885c2a55039e60df7f19e9218d98e3d5f0161.jpg"},{"name":"Shellshine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3959050/8a32c7305a4750ad7d7aae029cf0954826a27707.jpg"},{"name":"Macho Turtle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3959050/9b09aac0c04f426745547f671a474abe3b98f210.jpg"},{"name":"Shell Titan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3959050/725ca202289447378efe8b1eaed89c9c76d8dfde.jpg"},{"name":"Brainy Turtle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3959050/b9b671ea335d01b367968b7ba57f2158d5e096f6.jpg"},{"name":"Wise Old Shell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3959050/514a0ef8c963085aed397802619e8c146ed02b28.jpg"}],"total":74},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959050?t=1768834691","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/d56d3a91f9db500f9b002c478ddd1991e598bf44/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768834691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/8cdba1a9d1e553668913583f6cd1e7ef99cf405f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768834691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/8cdba1a9d1e553668913583f6cd1e7ef99cf405f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768834691","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swim. Grow. Try again.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Siegeturtle</strong> is a cozy idle roguelite auto-battler about a turtle making its way home through hostile seas. Your turtle moves automatically while companions support you along the journey. Upgrade attributes, skills, and equipment to push a little further with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/dde818f49810f21dd7ac2c758b76d0f9.poster.avif?t=1768834691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/dde818f49810f21dd7ac2c758b76d0f9.webm?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/dde818f49810f21dd7ac2c758b76d0f9.mp4?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A jetpack? A cannon? Why not both! Blast through diverse biomes with quirky upgrades and unexpected power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/9cbf853f6c5aa62983e5c72ae4c316e6.poster.avif?t=1768834691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/9cbf853f6c5aa62983e5c72ae4c316e6.webm?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/9cbf853f6c5aa62983e5c72ae4c316e6.mp4?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Companions!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit dolphins, unicorns, seals and more! Each grants a unique ability to your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/2bf6750cd0b1ae17d4794f48195db985.poster.avif?t=1768834691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/2bf6750cd0b1ae17d4794f48195db985.webm?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/2bf6750cd0b1ae17d4794f48195db985.mp4?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish for Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your turtle out to fish between battles. Sell your catch for gold, or keep them for passive stat bonuses. Upgrade your <i>imaginary fishing rod</i> to reel in even rarer finds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/dab3c52bec7f2fca28b47088f10d556d.poster.avif?t=1768834691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/dab3c52bec7f2fca28b47088f10d556d.webm?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/dab3c52bec7f2fca28b47088f10d556d.mp4?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up your favorite attributes!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strength, Agility, Intelligence, or Vitality. Which will you choose?\u00a0</strong>Each attribute shapes your turtle in unique ways, letting you grow stronger with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your playstyle.\u00a0</strong>Spend skill points to upgrade your turtle and companions, unlocking abilities that match how you like to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt for legendary loot.\u00a0</strong>Summon powerful bosses to earn new gear and discover synergies that boost gold gain, regeneration, drop rates, critical hits, and more. Break down unwanted equipment into upgrade materials to raise your summoning level and increase your chances of scoring rare items.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend and Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the time is right, reset your journey in a surge of new power. Each ascension grants permanent upgrades to make your turtle faster and stronger than before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.poster.avif?t=1768834691\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.webm?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959050/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.mp4?t=1768834691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["YYZ Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"